{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00152",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.36,
      "end_seconds": 6.75,
      "duration_seconds": 5.39,
      "text": "So, hello there. Please, sit. Is the form from the front desk all filled in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 7.65,
      "end_seconds": 11.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "I think so, I handed it in at the counter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 12.1,
      "end_seconds": 14.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Go ahead, tell me what's happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 15.44,
      "end_seconds": 24.26,
      "duration_seconds": 8.82,
      "text": "Um, so... blood in my urine. That's why I came. I kept putting it off, which I know isn't sensible."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.08,
      "end_seconds": 31.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "Is this recent, or has it been a while?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.08,
      "end_seconds": 36.94,
      "duration_seconds": 4.86,
      "text": "For ten days, I'd say. I've also been passing small clots."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.39,
      "end_seconds": 41.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "Have you been able to keep up with your usual activities?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 41.9,
      "end_seconds": 54.01,
      "duration_seconds": 12.11,
      "text": "For the most part, yes. I just carry on and try not to dwell on things too much, though I won't pretend it hasn't crossed my mind a few times."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.41,
      "end_seconds": 60.58,
      "duration_seconds": 5.17,
      "text": "Any difficulty passing urine, pain on passing urine or flank pain at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.53,
      "end_seconds": 63.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "No. None of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.56,
      "end_seconds": 68.69,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "Give me a second, I'm just scrolling back through your chart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 69.49,
      "end_seconds": 70.34,
      "duration_seconds": 0.85,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.13,
      "end_seconds": 90.84,
      "duration_seconds": 5.71,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. What about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.82,
      "end_seconds": 93.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "No, nothing I'm aware of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.67,
      "end_seconds": 97.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "I want to open your previous notes quickly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.24,
      "end_seconds": 99.03,
      "duration_seconds": 0.79,
      "text": "Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.0,
      "end_seconds": 119.97,
      "duration_seconds": 4.97,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.77,
      "end_seconds": 123.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "No, I've never had anything serious."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.59,
      "end_seconds": 127.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "Right, is the room warm enough for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.6,
      "end_seconds": 130.22,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "It's perfect, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.38,
      "end_seconds": 135.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "What about family history, any illnesses that run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 136.56,
      "end_seconds": 138.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "My father had kidney stones."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.39,
      "end_seconds": 142.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "Let me make a quick note of that before I forget."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.23,
      "end_seconds": 143.93,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.76,
      "end_seconds": 155.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. Any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.13,
      "end_seconds": 157.02,
      "duration_seconds": 0.89,
      "text": "Nothing, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.39,
      "end_seconds": 173.3,
      "duration_seconds": 15.91,
      "text": "What I'm doing here is putting together three things: what you tell me, what I find when I examine you, and what the tests show. None of those alone is enough, which is why we sometimes need to wait for results before being certain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 174.66,
      "end_seconds": 176.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "I appreciate you explaining that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 177.56,
      "end_seconds": 189.22,
      "duration_seconds": 11.66,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Weight 87 kilos, pulse is 67 beats a minute, height 175 centimetres, pressure 112 over 81, BMI works out to 28.4, saturation 99 percent, temperature 36.5."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.78,
      "end_seconds": 191.52,
      "duration_seconds": 0.74,
      "text": "Okay, noted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.49,
      "end_seconds": 197.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "Let me have a look at you now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.95,
      "end_seconds": 201.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Tell me if anything hurts as I press."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.31,
      "end_seconds": 219.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "Abdomen is soft, no masses, and no tenderness in the loins."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 219.86,
      "end_seconds": 220.84,
      "duration_seconds": 0.98,
      "text": "Yes, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.08,
      "end_seconds": 238.67,
      "duration_seconds": 13.59,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Good, that's all I need to examine. Let me gather my thoughts and then we'll talk it through together. Is there anyone at home who can help you out if you need it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 239.39,
      "end_seconds": 249.86,
      "duration_seconds": 10.47,
      "text": "Yes, there's family around most evenings, and they've been very good about checking in, although they do worry more than they need to."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.53,
      "end_seconds": 265.08,
      "duration_seconds": 11.55,
      "text": "Putting it all together, my working impression is blood in the urine that needs full investigation. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 265.93,
      "end_seconds": 270.28,
      "duration_seconds": 4.35,
      "text": "I've been thinking the worst, to be honest. Is it bad?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.83,
      "end_seconds": 293.87,
      "duration_seconds": 22.04,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's blood in the urine that needs full investigation, and we'll know more once the a urine culture is back. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had blood in your urine for ten days, and no difficulty passing urine or pain on passing urine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 294.5,
      "end_seconds": 296.05,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "Yes, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.68,
      "end_seconds": 298.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "How's everything else at home otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 300.07,
      "end_seconds": 306.69,
      "duration_seconds": 6.62,
      "text": "I mean, busy. Everyone's running in different directions at the moment, you know how it is."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 307.69,
      "end_seconds": 315.32,
      "duration_seconds": 7.63,
      "text": "We should do a urine culture for haematuria. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 315.87,
      "end_seconds": 316.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.02,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.4,
      "end_seconds": 327.09,
      "duration_seconds": 9.69,
      "text": "Keep drinking plenty of water, and let us know quickly if you pass clots or can't pass urine. I'll also refer you to the urology clinic."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 328.36,
      "end_seconds": 329.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2,
      "text": "Alright, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 330.77,
      "end_seconds": 340.63,
      "duration_seconds": 9.86,
      "text": "Please don't sit on it if you can't pass urine or pass large clots. That's the point to get seen urgently. Come back after the results are back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 340.98,
      "end_seconds": 342.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.75,
      "text": "Okay, I'll book that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 343.79,
      "end_seconds": 348.77,
      "duration_seconds": 4.98,
      "text": "So, can you run through the plan with me quickly, just to be certain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 349.48,
      "end_seconds": 355.01,
      "duration_seconds": 5.53,
      "text": "So, I come back after the results are back. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 356.09,
      "end_seconds": 361.63,
      "duration_seconds": 5.54,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Wonderful, I think that's it. Ask me anything before you go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 362.02,
      "end_seconds": 365.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "That's everything I wanted to ask. Thank you."
    }
  ]
}